      "short_description": "A renovated riverside stadium used for school, community, and sporting events with open views and a spacious athletic field.",
      "number_of_stations": null,
      "cuisine_description": null,
      "overall_description": "Boverini Stadium is a prominent, revitalized community landmark known for its high-quality athletic facilities and spacious design. Serving as a primary home for high school sports and significant local ceremonies, it offers a clean and welcoming environment for spectators and athletes alike. While the lack of ample dedicated parking makes access challenging during peak times, the stadium\u2019s excellent sightlines and modern amenities continue to make it a cherished venue for the local community.",
      "service_description": null,
      "ambience_description": "The atmosphere is vibrant and community-focused, characterized by clean facilities and a welcoming energy during local games and graduations. It blends a nostalgic sense of history with modern, well-kept amenities.",
      "amenities_description": "The stadium provides essential amenities including well-maintained restrooms, updated concession stands, and modern lighting for night games. The seating is designed for clear sightlines across the high-quality synthetic turf field.",
      "unique_selling_points": "The venue is defined by its beautiful renovation, which provides a high-quality, clean, and spacious environment for both competitive sports and major community milestones. Its location and elevated design ensure every seat has an excellent view of the action.",
      "neighborhood_description": "The stadium is nestled within a densely populated urban residential area, reflecting the local community vibe. It serves as a central hub for school and local sports, though the surrounding streets can become quite congested during large events.",
      "physical_setting_description": "Situated along the river, this renovated facility features an expansive, well-maintained athletic field and track. It offers open, elevated views of the playing surface from comfortable bleacher seating.",
      "customer_demographics_description": null,
